 841: /*
 842:  *  XXX_pc_to_pointers():
 843:  *
 844:  *  This function uses the current program counter (a virtual address) to
 845:  *  find out which physical translation page to use, and then sets the current
 846:  *  translation page pointers to that page.
 847:  *
